<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66933" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετασκευ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put into another dress</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκευή</span>), <i>change the fashion of, transform</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαυτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					499
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἅρματα εἰς τὸν αὐτὸν τρόπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.2.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. νόμον</span>
			<i>amend</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				1.42
			</span></i>; <i>put into a fresh shape</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς λέξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>exchange one's equipment with another</i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. εἰς τοὺς ὁπλίτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.60a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pack up so as to change one's quarters</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ αὑτοῦ παρά τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.Eph.
					5.13
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>shift oneself</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ . .
				εἰς</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				57
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				3.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>clothe oneself differently</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκετικαῖς ἐσθήσεσιν μ.</span>
			<i>disguise oneself</i> in . . , <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				6.49
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθεν μετεσκεύασθε</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.Prooem.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
